          "lexical_score": 2.6976938,
          "lexical_rank": 7,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Procedure codes and self-pay prices\n## Dental procedures\n\n- D2391: tooth-coloured filling on one surface of a back tooth - $210\n- D2140: silver (amalgam) filling on one surface - $160\n- D7140: simpl",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
